imbridge Focus status: macOS 26.4+ renamed IMHandleAvailabilityManager's _fetchUpdatedStatusForHandle:completion: to
fetchUpdatedStatusForHandle:completion:, so check-focus-status always answered "Selector not found". Use whichever
exists; answer with an error instead of never answering when the handle or the class is missing; and include the raw
availability status alongside silenced.

